    "comment": "The Copperbell Mines' last boss (BNpcBase 14537, layout 9060676): 10582 HP, level 17, appears after its cutscene. Auto-attack 6499; 28762 (5.7 s), 28760 (5.7 s, no damage), 28764 (4.7 s), 28763 (3.7 s) in a 47.7 s round, the same in all three runs. Its five helpers (BNpcBase 9020) cast 28761 (5.7 s, 127 to a player) 22 s in and every 47.7 s; Kawari doesn't spawn them. From Bob's Chronofoil captures of the Copperbell Mines (2026-10-25): one run with Duty Support (bd298651, visit 0.5) and two Duty Finder runs (69bea0b9, visits 0.1 and 0.3), `questkit chronofoil --battle`. `players` is the median damage to players over the three runs, `npcs` to the Duty Support members; `every` the median time between uses. Hitbox not recorded. Lock-on 218 over the target as 28764 begins (ActorControl 34, every cast in the three runs)."
